{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさみさおたおめみさみさ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさみさ(衛藤美彩chan)のお誕生日会しました∩^ω^∩★\nお姉たまー♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それがね。このまえせいたん(畠中清羅chan)家泊まった次の日に\nせいたん、みさみさ、ひめたんと３人でもお泊まりしたのよー。\nしっかりしとって尊敬する!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさみさお姉たま声が優しいのよ(^^)みなさんもそう思いますよねー？\nらすとteenだそうです。楽しい1年になりますように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、日芽香ちゃんは初詣には行かれましたかー？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初詣は3日までに行けばOKだった気がする(｀・∀・´)\n今日中に行ければセーフだね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは行けなかった('・ω・`)\n代わりに昨日家族みんなで行ってくれたみたいです♪\nそして代わりにおみくじ引いてくれたんと。\nひめたんの今年の運勢はー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どぅるどぅるどぅるどぅるーじゃじゃじゃん!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大吉!!!!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/images/2012/01/04/himeka0043.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃなくて\nひめたん小吉。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(`・ω・')"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いちばんリアクションに困る結果ですよね。可もなく不可もなく。\nうん\n今年も頑張ろーう!おー(ω)/!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というわけでひめたんのお正月エピソードはもうちょっと続きますよー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中元家はまた今年も「夢叶う矢」てのを買ったんだって!\n去年はぴんくで、今年はゴールド(//ω//)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/images/2012/01/04/himeka0041.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもね、矢を買うときにね、ほんとは去年の矢を返さなきゃなんだけど\nおうちに忘れてきちゃったらしいのよー。\nだから来年２本返すことにしますっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初夢何か見ましたか～？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー覚えてない('・ω・`)\nしかもその日年賀状書いとってあんま寝とらん...\nうー来年こそは富士・鷹・なすび!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お正月といえばお年玉、ひめたんはもらったのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぱぱままの分は送ってもらったです♪\n親戚のみなさんには今年ご挨拶できんかった('・ω・`)←\nお年玉とかいらんけ会いたい!\n親戚のクッキーちゃんってヨーキーにも会いたーい!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんもお餅食べたかな？\nひめたんはなに餅が好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お雑煮のお餅を２分の１こ食べた(・∀・)\nいつもはもっぱらきなこ餅派!ひめたんいっつも焼く係よーお♪\n電子レンジだって美味しく焼けるんぢゃけ。うん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今気がついたんだけど、中元日芽香という名前に「元日」が入っているね☆\nすごく縁起のいい名前だね(^O^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中元日芽香...ほんまぢゃー!\n15年と8ヶ月半生きてて、始めて自分の名前の縁起の良さに気づいた瞬間。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お買い物に行って福袋を買ったのかな？\nお気に入りの洋服とかは入っていましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福袋買いましたよ(^^)\nひなぴょん(川後陽菜chan)とおんなじ福袋かったら、中身がまったくおんなじだったー\nおそろいってことですね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんを妹にしたいのですが、いいですか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん(ω)♪\nいや、ひめたんの中ではすでにお兄さんお姉さんとお話ししとるつもりーふふふ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シングルイベントで個別があるけど、ひめたんに何回も行くと迷惑ですか？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全然まったく!むしろ嬉しいーいいぃ♪♪\n何回も来てきてー!待ってますよー＼^^／\n楽しいお話いっぱいしたいな!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2012年最初のイベント「乃木坂46 新年のご挨拶させてくださいっ！会」\n行くよーって方はよろしくお願いします(^^)ノ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はねー、お正月らしいことする予定だよねきっとね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よし。\nイベントにそなえて今日は早く寝る。\n明日も頑張るんぢゃけ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}